{"availability":"available","full":"MattiaPasti/Social-Finder","name":"Social-Finder","description":"Social Finder is an OSINT web app to search usernames across hundreds of platforms. Built with Flask and powered by Sherlock, it’s fast, privacy-friendly, and easy to deploy with Docker. A clean dashboard and a live demo make it simple to explore instantly.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":36,"forks":3,"created":"2025-08-29T18:59:55Z","updated":"2026-04-24T13:28:46Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sfinder.mattiapasti.com","topics":["cybersecurity","docker","flask","gunicorn","information-gathering","open-source","osint","privacy","python","security-tools","sherlock","social-networks","username-checker","webapp"],"demo":"https://sfinder.mattiapasti.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T06:12:26.518Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T06:12:26.518Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T06:12:26.518Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:12:26.518Z","stars":36,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Social Finder is a Flask-based OSINT web application for finding public social profiles connected to a first name and last name.","It combines Sherlock username checks, direct profile probes, search-engine dorks, link validation heuristics, a modern dashboard UI, PDF export, anti-spam controls, and an optional Premium login mode.","The project is designed as a professional portfolio application: privacy-conscious, containerized, hardened for deployment, and explicit about responsible use."],"features":["🔍 Generates likely username variants from a first name and last name.","⚡ Searches public profiles with Sherlock.","🌐 Extends coverage with direct probes for platforms such as GitHub, GitLab, Reddit, Threads, Bluesky, Mastodon, Twitch, Medium, Dev.to, Behance, Dribbble, Pinterest, SoundCloud, Telegram, Linktree, About.me, and more.","🧠 Validates candidate links with stricter heuristics for 404 pages, generic login redirects, private profiles, unavailable pages, and minimal responses.","📊 Displays results in a responsive dashboard with counters, status filters, text filtering, collapsible details, and clickable cards."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MattiaPasti/Social-Finder/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9744360047f66b5b2cb56f34dc2f536d56e692e6669c84315b250e83a58168bd","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T06:12:26.666Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T06:12:26.666Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Social Finder is a Flask-based OSINT web application for finding public social profiles connected to a first name and last name.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MattiaPasti/Social-Finder/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"It combines Sherlock username checks, direct profile probes, search-engine dorks, link validation heuristics, a modern dashboard UI, PDF export, anti-spam controls, and an optional Premium login mode.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MattiaPasti/Social-Finder/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"🧠 Validates candidate links with stricter heuristics for 404 pages, generic login redirects, private profiles, unavailable pages, and minimal responses.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MattiaPasti/Social-Finder/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"9744360047f66b5b2cb56f34dc2f536d56e692e6669c84315b250e83a58168bd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MattiaPasti/Social-Finder/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T06:12:26.667Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-04-24T13:28:46Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MattiaPasti/Social-Finder/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T06:12:26.668Z","hash":"9744360047f66b5b2cb56f34dc2f536d56e692e6669c84315b250e83a58168bd","originalBytes":8569,"storedBytes":8569,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["rate","premium","docker","auth","max","pdf","logi